{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"100–101"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"120–121"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\">\\(r:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\operatorname{dom}r\">\\(I=\\operatorname{dom}r\\)</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(i)=(\\ell_i,\\tau_i)\">\\(r(i)=(\\ell_i,\\tau_i)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KC}\">\\(\\mathrm{KC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eb52618778abed91\" href=\"?note=eb52618778abed91\" title=\"43-df-kc-set\">43-df-kc-set</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a> 的部分函数接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\">\\(p:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；其定义域条件在断言中给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KC}(r)\\to\\exists M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists p:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Computable}(p)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)=I\\land\\left(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^{\\ell_i}\\;\\left((i,\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(p)\\land(\\sigma,\\tau_i)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(M)\\right)\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left((i,\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(p)\\land(j,\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(p)\\Rightarrow i=j\\right)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KC}(r)\\to\\exists M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists p:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Computable}(p)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)=I\\land\\left(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^{\\ell_i}\\;\\left((i,\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(p)\\land(\\sigma,\\tau_i)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(M)\\right)\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left((i,\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(p)\\land(j,\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(p)\\Rightarrow i=j\\right)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自由代码前沿上的贪心分裂算法有效分配所有请求。总权重至多 1 保证每一步都有足够容量；完整证明与有效索引取得见原书。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 6.6.1；印刷页 100–101，PDF 页 120–121。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kc-set","status":"resolved","id":"eb52618778abed91","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kc-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targe